{"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "rop", "ucas": "it(s: u32 in 0..255, d: u32 in 0..1000000) = d + s\nrop it", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "rop", "update": "d + s", "model": "gt1030", "order": "independent", "order_proof": "proved by SAT", "forms": [{"family": "blending", "state": "VK_BLEND_OP_ADD, source factor ONE, destination factor ONE on a float target (R32_SFLOAT): s + d", "holds_where": "the operands, the factors, both products and the result stay below 2^24 in magnitude (at most 1000255, the result in [0, 1000255], from the parameters' ranges)", "proof": "it and s + d expand to the same polynomial; every value is an integer below 2^24, which f32 holds, so no step of the blender rounds whatever its arithmetic, and the integer result (inside u32: no wrap) is the polynomial's", "class": "rop_blend", "available": false, "pipeline": "VkPipelineColorBlendAttachmentState: blendEnable, colorBlendOp = VK_BLEND_OP_ADD, srcColorBlendFactor = VK_BLEND_FACTOR_ONE, dstColorBlendFactor = VK_BLEND_FACTOR_ONE; an R32_SFLOAT colour attachment; one point per contribution, its position the cell, its colour s"}], "count": 1}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "rop it: it = d + s, applied once per fragment (s what a fragment brings, d the cell's value)\n  order: the result does not depend on the order of the fragments: it(s2, it(s1, d)) = it(s1, it(s2, d)) (proved by SAT)\n  fixed-function states that compute it (each a proposal: the pipeline changes):\n  blending: VK_BLEND_OP_ADD, source factor ONE, destination factor ONE on a float target (R32_SFLOAT): s + d\n      holds where the operands, the factors, both products and the result stay below 2^24 in magnitude (at most 1000255, the result in [0, 1000255], from the parameters' ranges)\n      it and s + d expand to the same polynomial; every value is an integer below 2^24, which f32 holds, so no step of the blender rounds whatever its arithmetic, and the integer result (inside u32: no wrap) is the polynomial's\n      price: rop_blend is not priced by gt1030 (not measured): unavailable\n      pipeline: VkPipelineColorBlendAttachmentState: blendEnable, colorBlendOp = VK_BLEND_OP_ADD, srcColorBlendFactor = VK_BLEND_FACTOR_ONE, dstColorBlendFactor = VK_BLEND_FACTOR_ONE; an R32_SFLOAT colour attachment; one point per contribution, its position the cell, its colour s\n  not in any price: the draw's setup (a render pass, the pipeline, one vertex per contribution) and reading the target back\n"}
{"id": 2, "ok": true, "cmd": "rop", "ucas": "it(s: u32, d: u32) = d | s\nrop it", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "rop", "update": "d | s", "model": "gt1030", "order": "independent", "order_proof": "proved by SAT", "forms": [{"family": "logic op", "state": "VK_LOGIC_OP_OR on an unsigned integer target (R32_UINT): s | d", "proof": "proved by SAT", "class": "rop_logic", "available": false, "pipeline": "VkPipelineColorBlendStateCreateInfo: logicOpEnable, logicOp = VK_LOGIC_OP_OR (the logicOp feature); an R32_UINT colour attachment; one point per contribution, its position the cell, its colour s"}], "count": 1}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "rop it: it = d | s, applied once per fragment (s what a fragment brings, d the cell's value)\n  order: the result does not depend on the order of the fragments: it(s2, it(s1, d)) = it(s1, it(s2, d)) (proved by SAT)\n  fixed-function states that compute it (each a proposal: the pipeline changes):\n  logic op: VK_LOGIC_OP_OR on an unsigned integer target (R32_UINT): s | d\n      proved by SAT\n      price: rop_logic is not priced by gt1030 (not measured): unavailable\n      pipeline: VkPipelineColorBlendStateCreateInfo: logicOpEnable, logicOp = VK_LOGIC_OP_OR (the logicOp feature); an R32_UINT colour attachment; one point per contribution, its position the cell, its colour s\n  not in any price: the draw's setup (a render pass, the pipeline, one vertex per contribution) and reading the target back\n"}
